Q1. What is the difference between GRANT and REVOKE?

GRANT gives permissions to a user.
REVOKE removes previously granted permissions.

Q2. What does WITH GRANT OPTION do?

It allows the user receiving the privileges to grant those same privileges to other users.

Q3. How do you view a user's permissions?

