SAVEPOINT Example
START TRANSACTION;

UPDATE Account
SET Balance = Balance + 5000
WHERE AccountNo = 1001;

SAVEPOINT SP1;

UPDATE Account
SET Balance = Balance - 3000
WHERE AccountNo = 1002;

ROLLBACK TO SP1;

COMMIT;

Result:

The deposit into Account 1001 is saved.
The withdrawal from Account 1002 is undone.
COMMIT permanently saves the remaining changes.
